+# Pirate WebArcade — vendored game sources (pinned).
+#
+# These games are third-party works we redistribute; we do NOT modify their
+# code. Each row pins exactly where the bytes came from so the import is
+# reproducible and attributable.
+#
+# Format (tab-separated, '#' comments and blank lines ignored):
+#   id  license  kind  repo  ref  subpath  bundle  dest
+#
+#   id       short stable id (also the PirateArcadeGames id)
+#   license  SPDX-ish license label (documentation only)
+#   kind     "repo" -> bundle = dist/ folder inside the repo archive
+#            "zip"  -> bundle = a standalone zip download (e.g. js13k entry)
+#   repo     owner/name, ALWAYS set (used to fetch LICENSE text)
+#   ref      git commit sha for repo/kind; a date/note for zip (documentation)
+#   subpath  for kind=repo, the folder inside the archive to copy
+#   bundle   for kind=zip, the url to download; "-" for kind=repo
+#   dest     folder under Resources/_Pirate/WebUI/Arcade/
+#
+# To refresh: run Scripts/sh/vendor-arcade-games.sh (optionally: <id> ...).
+# The script writes PROVENANCE.txt + LICENSE.txt into each dest; commit both.
+
+# --- games added 2026-09 (TV-era arcade expansion) ---
+# NOTE: stunts is CC BY-NC 4.0 (NonCommercial) — included with attribution.
+stunts	CC-BY-NC-4.0	repo	lopis/thirteen-terrible-stunts	5ee4f39c4c8d38c3c7d5a0c9f74d71de1697f12e	dist	-	ThirteenTerribleStunts
+yurts	MIT	repo	burntcustard/tiny-yurts	682fdf012260e7b815f38bbd119cdd9ccc0aae30	dist	-	TinyYurts
+13steps	MIT	zip	jonathan-vallet/js13k-2024	95cc8b7f3d049f1cdf13236786533f2af3ced7e5	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/13-steps-to-escape.zip	ThirteenSteps
+donotmake13	MIT	zip	sirxemic/js13k-2024	3a97665e166a64f72618130dc4e4778b1c7b3604	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/do-not-make-13.zip	DoNotMake13
+finalseconds	MIT	zip	jani-nykanen/those-final-seconds	222396ade1082fedd76b5d8bd586179b052a167b	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/those-final-seconds.zip	ThoseFinalSeconds
+# fri3 (FRI3) removed: it loads its WASM via fetch() against res://, which the
+# stock engine's scheme registration doesn't allow (needs FetchEnabled), so it
+# fails silently for launcher clients too. Re-add only if we ship an engine that
+# enables fetch on res://.
+sector13	MIT	zip	BenjaminWFox/Sector-13-Js13k-2024	76bc259a237c17b0f4da7866a68460de9c4bd44b	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/sector-13.zip	Sector13
+
+# --- games added 2026-09 (batch 2) ---
+# NOTE: knight-dreams and dying-dreams use bespoke non-commercial licenses
+# (open-source + attribution required, no commercial use) — included with
+# attribution; see each PROVENANCE. super-castle-game is GPL-3.0.
+knightdreams	NonCommercial	zip	jani-nykanen/knight-dreams	d25009c4a043e7213ab1e8e62fee5c1f62393519	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/knight-dreams.zip	KnightDreams
+dyingdreams	NonCommercial	zip	jani-nykanen/dying-dreams	2b72c423898f577465a25a44465571e6e486563b	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/dying-dreams.zip	DyingDreams
+ghosted	MIT	zip	jani-nykanen/ghosted	846454c3b2f7509515cbcbf8852b09f7b7d98b24	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/ghosted.zip	Ghosted
+supercastle	GPL-3.0	zip	mvasilkov/super2023	617034ee9884cd50df4dc7c8daa910679c6f7dde	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/super-castle-game.zip	SuperCastleGame
+numberknight	Apache-2.0	zip	adrien-gueret/number_knight	21c70a62bfb459ea50503308158cf14c4ecd8573	-	https://js13kgames.com/games/number-knight.zip	NumberKnight
